{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-wrath", "type": "material"}, "note": "断片60編における赦し・裁く0回と『許されない』3回の非対称実測が、40本目のモチーフを開く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-ddb86b", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-20261024-71dfe0", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-wrath", "type": "material"}, "note": "passion_audit（感嘆符・涙・嫉妬）と wrath_audit（裁・許・謝の複合語分解と法廷・赦し）が同じ60編を二方向から照らす。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-35685d", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-passion", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-94d91b", "type": "material"}, "note": "アイスキュロス『エウメニデス』は、PR #55 の『イリアス』第1歌の英雄的憤怒と血讐を公的法廷と地下の『畏れ』へ転換する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-6fc271", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3bdc7c", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-484adf", "type": "material"}, "note": "アクィナス『神学大全』第158問は、PR #55 のセネカ『怒りについて』の怒り全否定に対し、秩序回復の義憤と無感覚の悪徳を切り分ける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-af5107", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-cb2d2f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-b9cacc", "type": "material"}, "note": "屈原『離騒』は、既存台帳の司馬遷『報任安書』が発憤著書の筆頭に挙げた源流そのものである。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-2dadca", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-37b031", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e30450", "type": "material"}, "note": "孟子の『羞悪の心は義の端なり』は、PR #55 のベネディクト『菊と刀』の外的世間体モデルに先立つ内面的正義としての恥を示す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-a0ed27", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e71025", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d6a2a6", "type": "material"}, "note": "自己再建の倫理として恥を擁護するウィリアムズと、法制度による公開羞恥刑の暴力を批判するヌスバウム（2004）が境界線を画定する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-dc072f", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-2d3e68", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-265051", "type": "material"}, "note": "同害報復の権利を認めた上で赦免と修復（イスラーフ）を称揚するクルアーン42章は、PR #55 のニーチェの『無力の粉飾』批判と対峙する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-188f38", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-f4f04c", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-47e97a", "type": "material"}, "note": "ジャンケレヴィッチの『赦しを乞わぬ大罪は赦しえない』という拒絶は、既存台帳のデリダ『赦すこと』の直接の論争相手である。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-457e0c", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-04aeac", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-216a2c", "type": "material"}, "note": "ゼアの修復的司法（規則違反から関係修復への三問転換）は、PR #55 のヌスバウム『怒りと赦し』（2016）の制度的実践形態をなす。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-93a6bb", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-cbe73e", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-59ae1b", "type": "material"}, "note": "LLM-as-a-Judge の冗長さバイアスは、プラトン『ゴルギアス』が警告した『流暢な弁論の衣による審判の眩惑』を統計的に再現する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-53547b", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e822ec", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-69c7ed", "type": "material"}, "note": "人間レッドチーマーによる38,961件の挑発記録（Ganguli ら）は、Constitutional AI の自己検閲原則の前史をなす。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-cc2390", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-06", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-2baccf", "type": "material"}, "note": "責任転嫁を伴う謝罪が無謝罪より信頼を壊すという実験結果は、太宰『人間失格』の『関係を壊す謝罪形式』と響き合う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-9fe3df", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-ebd1d5", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-a65a17", "type": "material"}, "note": "SNSの強化学習は人間の道徳的憤慨を増幅し、対話AIのRLHFは機械の怒りを消去するという現代の非対称をなす。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-203656", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-69c7ed", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-d4d41b", "type": "material"}, "note": "安全データ過剰投入による決定境界の膨張（Bianchi ら）が、XSTest の38%無害プロンプト完全拒絶（Röttger ら）の病因を説明する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-0287ef", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-dbe783", "type": "material"}}
